WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.400
Del: Hello?! Can anyone hear me?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.000
Del: Who are you?

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.720
Luke: I heard you call out. Sounded like you need help.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.480
Del: Yeah, I do. You think you can get me out of this?

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.200
Luke: Hold still.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.920
Del: I know who you are. Why'd you help me?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.560
Luke: Because you asked.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.000
Del: No no no no, that won't do it. This will!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:48.820
Luke: No, wait!

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:38.880
Del: I've heard a hundred stories about the Jedi. They terrified me as a boy on Coruscant, but you...

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.980
Luke: Come on. We need to work together if we're going to get out of here.
